CORE PRODUCT MODEL

The system is organized around:

Campaigns

Content Items

CAMPAIGN

A campaign represents a topic, project, or marketing initiative.

Example:

Campaign: Cloud Computing

Campaign: Digital Marketing

Each campaign can contain up to 5 content items in the MVP.

Campaigns also have:

• Goal (marketing goal)

• Platform (target platform)

• Settings JSON (dynamic campaign settings)

Examples of campaign goals:

• Brand Awareness

• Traffic

• Lead Generation

• Sales

• Engagement

• Content Promotion

CONTENT ITEM

A content item represents one piece of generated content.

Examples:

Title: Benefits of Cloud Storage

Platform: Website

Fields may include:

• Title

• Platform (Website, Twitter, LinkedIn, etc.)

• Main Keyword

• Additional Keywords

• Description / Context

• Content Goal

• Content Length

• Language

Content Items belong to a Campaign.

DYNAMIC FORM SYSTEM

The system uses dynamic form schemas stored in the database.

Different combinations of:

Goal + Platform

produce different form structures.

Example:

Goal: Traffic

Platform: Website

Fields might include:

• page_title

• main_keywords

• content_length

• target_url

• description

Form schemas are stored as JSON and versioned.

Tables involved:

CampaignGoal

Platform

CampaignFormSchema

CampaignForm

This allows the product to support different campaign types without changing backend code.

CONTENT CREATION WORKFLOW

Content creation happens in several stages.

RESEARCH STAGE
User provides:

• keyword

• description

• context

The system then:

searches Google
collects top search results
scrapes article content
cleans extracted text
sends text to AI for analysis
AI returns:

• summary of each source

• key insights

• important facts

• extracted keywords

• possible article structure

User can:

• remove sources

• add custom URLs

• paste manual text

• re-run research

OUTLINE GENERATION
After confirming sources, the AI generates an outline.

Example:

H1: Cloud Storage Benefits

H2: What is Cloud Storage

H2: Advantages of Cloud Storage

H2: Security Considerations

H2: Cost Benefits

FAQ

Conclusion

User can:

• edit headings

• add sections

• remove sections

CONTENT GENERATION
The AI generates the full article using:

• keyword

• research summaries

• outline

• content goal

• platform

• language

• desired length

EDITING
User can:

• edit text manually

• regenerate sections

• add new sections

EXPORT
MVP export options:

• copy text

• download text

Future versions:

• publish to CMS

• publish to social media platforms

